# ludic.citizens - a persistent life simulation for a large population: who lives where, works where, what
# they need, what they do about it, what it costs and pays, and how they get there. Far from a player a
# citizen is an event (at a place until a time, then travelling until another); near, they are handed to the
# game's crowd, traffic and NPCs through ports. Every decision is a pure function of a seed and the citizen's
# state, so any machine computes any citizen's day and only what the world changed is sent. Uses ludic.base
# and nothing else. See README.md.
package "ludic.citizens"
version "0.1.0"
kind source
